( REPEATED FIXED POINT SQUARING. )
VARIABLE SX VARIABLE SSTART VARIABLE SSUM VARIABLE SM
: SQUARE
  3 1 DO I SM ! 1000 I 1+ - SSTART ! 0 SSUM !
    I 100 * 0 DO
      SSTART @ SX !
      8 0 DO SX @ DUP F* SX ! LOOP
      SSUM @ SX @ 10 / + SSUM !
    LOOP
    ." SQUARE " SM @ . SSUM @ . SX @ . CR
  LOOP ;
SQUARE
